"""Build a source-linked summary without hiding failed family/seed gates."""
from pathlib import Path
import json,hashlib,statistics
root=Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent
read=lambda p:json.loads(p.read_text())
rows=[]
for p in sorted((root/'results/timing').glob('heldout-*.json')):
    r=read(p);summaries=[s for s in r['summaries'] if s['variant']=='lean' and s['scope']=='field']
    rows.append({'config':r['config'],'raw':'timing/'+p.name,'sourceHash':r['sourceHash'],'previous':next(s for s in summaries if s['reference']=='previous-zero'),'legacy':next(s for s in summaries if s['reference']=='legacy'),'checksumsPassed':all(c['passed'] for x in r['rows'] for c in x['checksums'].values()),'sourceUnchanged':r['sourceUnchanged'],'inputUnchanged':r['inputUnchanged']})
main=[r for r in rows if r['config']['count']>=100];wins=sum(r['previous']['qualified'] for r in main)
checks=[read(root/f'results/checks-{stage}.json') for stage in ['tiny','development','heldout']]
errors={k:max(x[k] for c in checks for row in c['rows'] for x in row['metrics']) for k in ['inflow','force','moment']}
summary={'selected':'lean','sourceHash':hashlib.sha256((root/'src/exact-aero.cjs').read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'headline':f'Lean bound-free exact evaluation passed the preregistered field-time gate in {wins}/{len(main)} held-out N100/200 cases. Scaling stopped before N500.','limitation':'N200 improved consistently in only the sparse family; dense and tilted results were mixed. Mean wakes and receiver forces remain physically unvalidated. CPU field timings are separate from replay rendering.','primaryCriterion':'Per-case median ratio<=0.9 and paired bootstrap95 upper<1 versus previous-zero; independent comparison versus legacy is retained.','rows':rows,'correctness':{'cases':sum(c['cases'] for c in checks),'maxErrors':errors,'allPassed':all(c['passed'] for c in checks)},'scaleDecision':{'N500':'not run','reason':'At N200 only sparse passed on both held-out seeds; conservative two-family gate not established.'}}
if (root/'results/pipeline.json').exists():
    summary['primaryPipeline']=read(root/'results/pipeline.json')['summaries']
if (root/'results/boids/index.json').exists():
    index=read(root/'results/boids/index.json');summary['boids']={'records':len(index['records']),'completed':sum(r['metrics']['complete'] for r in index['records']),'comparisons':index['comparisons'],'refinements':index['refinements']}
(root/'results/timing-summary.json').write_text(json.dumps(summary,indent=2))
lines=['# Exact-equation airflow efficiency campaign','','## Result',summary['headline'],'','The frozen lean implementation removes positive omission-budget bounds and allocation-heavy geometry operations while keeping all four rotors and every positive in-model contribution. Conservative support culling and reusable geometry scratch were tested separately; their added work did not consistently beat lean. This is software-equivalence evidence for an unvalidated finite-support model, not physical validation or a new accuracy–cost frontier.','','## Frozen methods and controls','','- Legacy: unchanged milestone-28 sum-rotor field.','- Previous-zero: unchanged prior campaign zero-budget module, including omission-bound calculation.','- Lean: scalar geometry/kernel with no pair bounds.','- Support: lean plus conservative exact-zero pair support checks.','- Reuse: support with refreshed internal geometry scratch; caller-owned returned winds.','','Original source checkpoint: `c024dfc27b9e6b7cd5b39132164d1339cb95b12f`. Mechanics/wake baseline: `c591ce2b195fa01b895d4ba881a44a4b92fdd703`. New module SHA256: `'+summary['sourceHash']+'`. Selection used development seeds 4301/4302 only; held-out seeds were4391/4392. [Selection record](results/selection.json).','','The original eight-step roadmap remains in force: define the experiment, preserve mechanics, verify pair interaction, verify overlapping sums, run genuine local3D Boids, measure CPU efficiency, scale conditionally, and evaluate limitations. This campaign makes no claim that physical-validation steps are complete.','','## Correctness and retained failures','',f"{summary['correctness']['cases']} primary tiny/development/held-out prescribed-state cases passed. Maximum error versus legacy: inflow {errors['inflow']:.17g} m/s; force {errors['force']:.17g} N; moment {errors['moment']:.17g} N m. These tolerances are model-relative, not measured aerodynamic accuracy.",'','Independent checks test boundaries, permutation/translation behavior, changing swarm sizes, mutated states and stable ownership of returned wind arrays. Raw independent reports accompany the checkpoint.','', 'A retained v0 error at a huge coordinate translation rounded a receiver-rotor offset beyond the nominal support envelope: legacy/lean produced0.001587065203100887m/s while support/reuse produced0. The fixed numeric API rejects position components with absolute magnitude above1e6m and adds conservative roundoff margin within that range. A pre-existing legacy/previous-grid hang at1e20m is also retained. These are implementation/input-domain findings. No positive interaction is intentionally dropped on the accepted domain. See [amendments](AMENDMENTS.md) and [retained v0](source-versions/exact-aero-v0.cjs.txt).','','## Held-out CPU field measurements','','All five variants ran serially, in paired rotated orders, with nine repeats per held-out case. Field timing includes finite/unit/range validation, refreshed geometry, grid search, kernel evaluation and caller-owned output. Every complete output is checksum-verified outside the timed interval. Field+receiver evaluation is separate. Receiver-only repeated measurements run identical code and are a noise control. Reuse construction timing covers empty evaluator construction; first geometry allocation occurs during warmup. Small warmup/sample budgets, shared-host interference and timing outliers limit hardware-generalization.','','| N | Family | Seed | Lean / previous-zero (95% paired bootstrap) | Gate | Legacy / lean speed | Raw |','|---:|---|---:|---|---|---:|---|']
for r in rows:
    c=r['config'];p=r['previous'];ci=p['bootstrap95'];lines.append(f"| {c['count']} | {c['family']} | {c['seed']} | {p['medianRatio']:.3f} [{ci[0]:.3f}, {ci[1]:.3f}] | {'pass' if p['qualified'] else 'fail'} | {1/r['legacy']['medianRatio']:.2f}× | [record](results/{r['raw']}) |")
lines+=['','At N100, sparse and dense pass on both primary held-out seeds; tilted passes only one. At N200, sparse passes both, dense neither, and tilted only one. Therefore N500 was not run. A favorable result for one seed does not stand in for family-wide replication.','','## Genuine Boids replay and whole pipeline','','All14 planned actual Boids recordings completed: two seeds, N16 for1second and N50 for3seconds, each legacy/previous-zero/lean, plus two separate N16 cadence refinements. All8 matched implementation comparisons had identical SHA256 streams over every integrated full state and held rotor field, with zero saved-pose differences. [Replay index](results/boids/index.json) · separately supplied offline HTML · [repository demo](demo/index.html). These short starting-cloud windows do not establish obstacle-course or full-mission success.','', 'Primary fixed-work N16/1s pipeline timing used seven paired repetitions, one warmup per method,400physics steps and100field updates. All terminal full-state/held-field hashes matched. Lean/legacy total-time ratio was0.847, paired95% interval[0.797,0.918]; lean/previous-zero was0.911,[0.901,0.960]. The latter8.9% median saving is below10%, and this tiny development workload does not establish general end-to-end gains. [Raw primary pipeline](results/pipeline.json).','', 'Separate N16/1s numerical checks gave maximum saved-position differences7.21nm for halved physics step and7.01mm for halved airflow interval. Both are below the predeclared1cm short-window screen, but the much larger refresh sensitivity and prior long-horizon failures remain unresolved.','', '## Independent robustness replication','', 'Independent fresh lattice-based fixtures and seeds passed their own preregistered primary field gate versus legacy in12/12nonzero cases: lean/legacy ratios0.498–0.708. Against previous-zero, ratios0.856–0.965 passed the individual10% gate in4/12cases. No family/count passed on both independent seeds; this is an additional robustness observation, not a retrospective failure of the independent primary comparator. The independent protocol times checksum accumulation inside its field interval, unlike the primary protocol; results are not pooled.','', 'An independent9-repetition N16 whole-pipeline workload gave lean/legacy0.917,[0.885,0.967], and lean/previous-zero0.960,[0.936,1.018]. These smaller gains reinforce the workload-specific interpretation. All independent final full-state hashes matched, with zero final-state difference across its27timed members. Terminal held-wind hashes were not retained in that independent run; the primary A5 pipeline additionally verifies those winds. Independent methods, raw records and review accompany the published checkpoint.','', 'Overall: cumulative field acceleration over allocation-heavy legacy is robust. The extra gain over the previous optimized zero-budget implementation is modest and workload-sensitive. No N500 promotion, retuning on held-out data, or browser/GPU claim followed the mixed results.','','## Reproduction and limitations','','See [README](README.md), [frozen plan](PLAN.md), [configuration](configs/campaign.json) and [provenance](provenance.json). Each raw timing record links its deterministic fixture input and retains full paired measurements; incomplete/failing records are not pooled as successful measurements. Public copies omit private machine/process observations with a disclosed editorial manifest.','','The source has fixed isolated-hover strength, finite support2.5m downstream/three half-widths radially and3m center search. It does not model general rotor-speed-dependent emission, rotor-resolved source flow, wake deformation, turbulence, or validated multi-vehicle interference. Receiver force response and multi-wake superposition are unvalidated. Existing airflow-refresh and long-horizon trajectory sensitivity are not resolved by exact-code acceleration. This campaign does not establish browser/WebGPU throughput, full-mission safety or5,000-drone feasibility.']
report='\n'.join(lines)+'\n'
for old,new in {'All14':'All 14','All8':'All 8','N16':'N=16','N50':'N=50','N100':'N=100','N200':'N=200','N500':'N=500','local3D':'local 3D','seed4391':'seed 4391','were4391':'were 4391','for1second':'for 1 second','for3seconds':'for 3 seconds','400physics':'400 physics','100field':'100 field','was0.':'was 0.','paired95%':'paired 95%','interval[':'interval [','latter8.9%':'latter 8.9%','below10%':'below 10%','differences7.21nm':'differences 7.21 nm','and7.01mm':'and 7.01 mm','predeclared1cm':'predeclared 1 cm','in12/12nonzero':'in 12/12 nonzero','ratios0.':'ratios 0.','individual10%':'individual 10%','in4/12cases':'in 4/12 cases','independent9-repetition':'independent 9-repetition','support2.5m':'support 2.5 m','and3m':'and 3 m','or5,000':'or 5,000','above1e6m':'above 1e6 m','at1e20m':'at 1e20 m','produced0.':'produced 0.','produced0':'produced 0','887m/s':'887 m/s'}.items():report=report.replace(old,new)
(root/'REPORT.md').write_text(report)
print(json.dumps({'heldoutCases':len(rows),'N100_200GatePass':wins,'correctness':summary['correctness']}))
